# Principal eleven-block cyclic-line assembly

The preparation module supplies roots compatible with the specified block
prime, all eleven real ordinary vertices, and the degree-one endpoint lemma.
The shared module-valued `PrimeOrderRealLine.Tree` interface retains actual
simple modules, projective modules and their lifted character identities.

